{"seq":3,"slug":"color-theory-viz","title":"数据可视化中的色彩理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-principles/color-theory-viz","wordCount":1731,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据可视化中的色彩理论\">数据可视化中的色彩理论</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>色彩理论是数据可视化设计中最具影响力的视觉编码手段之一。合理运用色彩能够帮助读者快速区分类别、感知数值大小、发现数据模式，而不当的色彩选择则会导致信息误读甚至歧视性排斥。数据可视化中的色彩理论不仅继承了传统美术中的色彩学知识，还需要结合人类视觉感知、色彩空间数学模型以及无障碍设计原则。</p>\n<p>色彩在可视化中承担三种核心编码角色，理解它们的适用场景和设计约束是构建高质量可视化的基础：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分类编码：用不同色相区分类别</li>\n<li>顺序编码：用明度或饱和度梯度表达数值大小</li>\n<li>发散编码：用双向色阶表示偏离基准值的程度</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[色彩编码类型] --&gt; B[分类编码]&#10;    A --&gt; C[顺序编码]&#10;    A --&gt; D[发散编码]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[色相差异区分类别]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[最多 8-12 个类别]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[单色明度梯度]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[连续数值映射]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[双向色阶]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[中性基准色]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[正负偏离方向]\">graph TD\n    A[色彩编码类型] --&gt; B[分类编码]\n    A --&gt; C[顺序编码]\n    A --&gt; D[发散编码]\n    B --&gt; B1[色相差异区分类别]\n    B --&gt; B2[最多 8-12 个类别]\n    C --&gt; C1[单色明度梯度]\n    C --&gt; C2[连续数值映射]\n    D --&gt; D1[双向色阶]\n    D --&gt; D2[中性基准色]\n    D --&gt; D3[正负偏离方向]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码类型</th>\n<th>适用数据</th>\n<th>色彩维度</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>类别上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分类编码</td>\n<td>名义型数据</td>\n<td>色相</td>\n<td>饼图、分组柱状图</td>\n<td>8-12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺序编码</td>\n<td>有序/连续数据</td>\n<td>明度/饱和度</td>\n<td>热力图、等值线图</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发散编码</td>\n<td>偏离型数据</td>\n<td>双向色相+明度</td>\n<td>相关性矩阵、温度异常图</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"色彩空间与感知均匀性\">色彩空间与感知均匀性</h2><p>色彩空间是色彩理论的数学基础，不同的色彩空间对可视化设计有截然不同的影响。最常见的 RGB 和 HSL 色彩空间虽然在编程中使用广泛，但它们并不具备感知均匀性——在这些空间中等距的两组颜色在人眼看来可能差异悬殊。</p>\n<p>CIELAB（L<em>a</em>b*）色彩空间是国际照明委员会定义的感知均匀色彩空间，其中 L* 代表明度，a* 代表红绿轴，b* 代表黄蓝轴。在该空间中，欧氏距离与人类感知的色差近似成正比，这使得它成为构建可视化色板的理想基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LabColor {&#10;  l: number;&#10;  a: number;&#10;  b: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function labDistance(c1: LabColor, c2: LabColor): number {&#10;  return Math.sqrt((c1.l - c2.l) ** 2 + (c1.a - c2.a) ** 2 + (c1.b - c2.b) ** 2);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function interpolateLab(c1: LabColor, c2: LabColor, t: number): LabColor {&#10;  return {&#10;    l: c1.l + (c2.l - c1.l) * t,&#10;    a: c1.a + (c2.a - c1.a) * t,&#10;    b: c1.b + (c2.b - c1.b) * t,&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function generateSequentialPalette(start: LabColor, end: LabColor, steps: number): LabColor[] {&#10;  return Array.from({ length: steps }, (_, i) =&gt; interpolateLab(start, end, i / (steps - 1)));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> labDistance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((c1.l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c2.l) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c1.a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c2.a) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c1.b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c2.b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> interpolateLab</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    l: c1.l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c2.l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c1.l) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    a: c1.a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c2.a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c1.a) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    b: c1.b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c2.b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c1.b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateSequentialPalette</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LabColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: steps }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> interpolateLab</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start, end, i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>HCL（Hue-Chroma-Luminance）色彩空间是 CIELAB 的极坐标变换，它将色相、饱和度和明度分离为独立维度，非常适合程序化生成可视化色板。在 HCL 空间中，固定明度和饱和度只改变色相，可以生成感知等距的分类色板。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色彩空间</th>\n<th>感知均匀</th>\n<th>可视化适用性</th>\n<th>计算复杂度</th>\n<th>浏览器原生支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RGB</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HSL</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CIELAB</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CSS Level 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HCL</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OKLab</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CSS Level 4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"色板设计策略\">色板设计策略</h2><p>色板设计是数据可视化中色彩理论的核心实践。一个优秀的色板需要同时满足美观性、可辨识性、语义一致性和无障碍兼容性四个维度的要求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分类色板\">分类色板</h3><p>用于区分离散类别。设计原则是在 HCL 空间中等间隔取色相，同时保持明度和饱和度一致，确保没有某个类别在视觉上显得更&quot;突出&quot;。D3.js 的 <code>d3.schemeCategory10</code> 和 ColorBrewer 的 <code>Set2</code> 都是经典分类色板。</p>\n<h3 id=\"顺序色板\">顺序色板</h3><p>用于表示有序或连续数据。设计原则是沿明度轴单调递增或递减，可以叠加少量色相偏移来增加辨识度。经典的 Viridis 色板在明度上严格单调，同时色相从紫色过渡到黄色，即使在灰度打印时也能保持可读性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"发散色板\">发散色板</h3><p>用于表示围绕中心值的正负偏离。设计原则是两端采用对比色相，中心采用低饱和度的中性色，明度在中心最高、两端对称下降。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type PaletteType = &#39;categorical&#39; | &#39;sequential&#39; | &#39;diverging&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface PaletteConfig {&#10;  type: PaletteType;&#10;  steps: number;&#10;  hueRange: [number, number];&#10;  chromaRange: [number, number];&#10;  luminanceRange: [number, number];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createCategoricalPalette(n: number): string[] {&#10;  const hueStep = 360 / n;&#10;  return Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) =&gt; {&#10;    const hue = (i * hueStep + 30) % 360;&#10;    return `oklch(0.7 0.15 ${hue})`;&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createSequentialPalette(n: number, hue: number): string[] {&#10;  return Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) =&gt; {&#10;    const t = i / (n - 1);&#10;    const lightness = 0.95 - t * 0.55;&#10;    const chroma = 0.02 + t * 0.18;&#10;    return `oklch(${lightness} ${chroma} ${hue})`;&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createDivergingPalette(n: number, hueNeg: number, huePos: number): string[] {&#10;  const mid = Math.floor(n / 2);&#10;  return Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) =&gt; {&#10;    const t = (i - mid) / mid;&#10;    const lightness = 0.95 - Math.abs(t) * 0.4;&#10;    const chroma = Math.abs(t) * 0.2;&#10;    const hue = t &lt; 0 ? hueNeg : huePos;&#10;    return `oklch(${lightness} ${chroma} ${hue})`;&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaletteType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'categorical'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sequential'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'diverging'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaletteConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaletteType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hueRange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span s